'''Bronze Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating [[Attack on D-Cyclone (Expert)|Heaven of Darkness]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]] increases attack power, range, grants full backswing and knockback chance at the cost of a longer delay between attacks. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Bronze Cat is obtainable when rolling the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] in Chapter 1. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she is unlocked when beating [[Broton (Cats of the Cosmos)|Broton]].

