==Trivia==
*Prior to being made obtainable in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]], Bronze Cat had completely different stats. At Lv.30, it had 10,200 health, 6,460 attack, 7.03 second attack frequency, 110 range, 8 speed, 1 knockback, 300 cost, 2-second recharge and [[Base Destroyer]]. Both forms had the same stats, and it could not Knockback Metal.
**These old stats may explain why Bronze Cat is somewhat confusingly called a meatshield in its description.
*[[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]] increased Bronze Cat's range from 140 to 160.
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Bronze Cat was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Precious Metals (Removed Combo)|Precious Metals]].
*Prior to [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]], Bronze Cat's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Bronze Cat
A good defensive cat with ridiculous health
and very decent offensive ability.
Might knockback Metal enemies (Area Attack)</pre>
<pre>Michelangelo Cat
Sucked into the world of art
and mastered everything about sculpting
Might knockback Metal enemies (Area Attack)</pre>
<pre>Quizmaster Cat
Has the longest winning streak on a popular
quiz show, although the questions are pretty easy.
Might knockback Metal enemies (Area Attack)</pre>
**The line, "although the questions are pretty easy," in Quizmaster Cat's original description can also be applied to ''Panel Quiz Attack 25''. In fact, it became a meme because of how many easy questions the original Colombia Poser got wrong despite ultimately winning.
*During the [[Anniversary/9th Year|9th Anniversary]] event, Quizmaster Cat could be seen by opening the doors in the [[Cat Base Menu]].
*Michelangelo Cat is based off of the ''[[wikipedia:Dying Slave|Dying Slave]]'', a sculpture created by [[wikipedia:Michelangelo|Michelangelo]], whom the Cat is also named after.
*The triumphant pose Bronze Cat and Quizmaster Cat strike after attacking is the [https://knowyourmeme.com/photos/443657-colombia-pose Colombia Pose], a Japanese [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/colombia-pose Internet meme] which originated from the quiz show ''Panel Quiz Attack 25''. The blue button turning red in Quizmaster Cat's animation is done in Japanese-style quiz/game shows to symbolize that the person has answered correctly. Thus, the cat is triumphing.
*Quizmaster Cat's overall attire is reminiscent of [[wikipedia:Uncle Sam|Uncle Sam]], a personification of the United States government. The colour theme supports this in a way.
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Michelangelo Cat is called David Cat, referencing the Michelangelo sculpture ''[[wikipedia:David (Michelangelo)|David]]''.
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Bronze Cat's description states that she is female.

